    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25762" root="ضرس" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرِيسٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>Stones resembling</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَضْرَاس</span> [i. e. <i>teeth</i> or
<i>lateral teeth</i> or <i>molar teeth</i>]: with such, a well is
cased. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And (assumed tropical:)  The <i>vertebræ of the back.</i>
(O, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضْرُوسَةٌ</span></b> , (assumed tropical:)  A well (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِئْرٌ</span>)
<i>cased with stones.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرِسٌ</span>.

